# Knowledge Graph Feeds subject taxonomy, v1 (2026-10-31).
# What a story is about. One line per subject, two spaces per level. A story is filed under one primary
# subject and any number of secondary ones; the angles inside a story (The money, Who did it...) are a separate,
# cross-story dimension kept in the feed code.
#   Label [iptc CODE] :: one-line description
# L1 follows the IPTC Media Topics top level (the news industry's standard, CC BY 4.0) with reader labels;
# Technology and Science split IPTC's "science and technology". L2 to L4 are authored where this site's stories
# concentrate: AI, cybersecurity, crypto, companies, markets, policy, and search and marketing.

